OL,3,GNEWSAThe cemetery secret linking
OL,4,AArsenal and Sky Blues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hint of euphoria lingers in the air
OL,7,Ffor Coventry City fans ahead of the
OL,8,Fteams' first match since their historic
OL,9,Freturn to the Premier League.
OL,11,FAs the Sky Blues prepare to go
OL,12,Fhead-to-head with Arsenal on Friday,
OL,13,Fthe two top-flight clubs share a
OL,14,Fremarkable, yet little-known historical
OL,15,Fconnection.
OL,17,FThe Victorian London Road Cemetery in
OL,18,FCoventry is the final resting place of
OL,19,Fboth David Danskin, who founded the
OL,20,FGunners, and Willie Stanley, the
OL,21,Fmastermind behind Coventry City.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
